{"unit_id":"hanshenmesen__dsh-turn-delete#feature-1","repo":"hanshenmesen/dsh-turn-delete","commit":"4716bcbdee27b110ceea9df21f027c6dfe5888b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-delete 的功能「删除指定轮次」：用户点击助手回复旁的删除操作并确认后，插件根据该助手消息定位轮次，将该轮提问、回复和工具记录从当前模型 surface 中移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/TurnDeleteAction.tsx:68-120","src/turn-delete.ts:99-164"]}
